      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753152683363,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prompt\n\nDesign a notification system responsible for sending notifications to\nusers (customers/hosts/employees) through various platforms like\nSMS, Push, Email and Tweets\n\nThere are two types of notifications:\n1. Single (Event Triggered)\n2. Bulk (Batch process)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prompt\n\nDesign a notification system responsible for sending notifications to\nusers (customers/hosts/employees) through various platforms like\nSMS, Push, Email and Tweets\n\nThere are two types of notifications:\n1. Single (Event Triggered)\n2. Bulk (Batch process)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6dgj3a2fM3LIA_vrSSPZt",
